{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UnknownAaguidAction"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"open","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" enum. A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list decodes to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than failing the response it arrived in (CONTRACT.md §27.11 rule 1). Throwing there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails the WHOLE response, so one field of one record would take down the page it was on,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including the records the caller did ask for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"access. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":" is never written: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"},{"text":" refuses it locally, before any request, as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"validation failure (CONTRACT.md §34.2 P12.2, contract 1.60 A4) — never as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\""},{"text":", never left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the server to refuse. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"text":" over these cases needs an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"text":" arm.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What to do with an AAGUID that has no MDS entry (i.e. FIDO Alliance has no metadata for it —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not necessarily malicious, MDS coverage is incomplete for some legitimate authenticators)."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"enum","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK19UnknownAaguidActionO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnknownAaguidAction","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UnknownAaguidAction"}],"title":"UnknownAaguidAction"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/allow","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/deny","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/unknown"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/init(from:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/init(rawValue:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/encode(to:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UnknownAaguidAction\/RawRepresentable-Implementations